# Existing first

Before a custom workflow: matching skill in `~/.cursor/skills` or `.cursor/skills`, then awesome lists / MCP (`discover-skills-mcp`). Do not invent crutches.

For Streamlit: official pack `streamlit/agent-skills` (`developing-with-streamlit`, `improving-streamlit-design`, `building-streamlit-dashboards`). Propose install; do not copy vendor skills into this git repo.

Non-trivial task → `crystal-pipeline` after this repo has `AGENTS.md`.

End of a repeatable cycle: `crystal-harvest-skill` (canon in the vault; mirror already global). One concrete `improve-always` proposal.

Do not copy a skill body into a rule. Do not default `disable-model-invocation: true`.
